			"notes": "CleanMCMod v0.2.0 - one jar per Minecraft version.\n\n| Minecraft | Java | Jar |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1.21.10 | 21 | `cleanmcmod-0.2.0+1.21.10.jar` |\n| 1.21.11 | 21 | `cleanmcmod-0.2.0+1.21.11.jar` |\n| 1.21.8 | 21 | `cleanmcmod-0.2.0+1.21.8.jar` |\n| 1.21.9 | 21 | `cleanmcmod-0.2.0+1.21.9.jar` |\n| 26.1 | 25 | `cleanmcmod-0.2.0+26.1.jar` |\n| 26.2 | 25 | `cleanmcmod-0.2.0+26.2.jar` |\n| 26.3 | 25 | `cleanmcmod-0.2.0+26.3.jar` |\n\n**Tested configuration.** The author tests only the latest Minecraft\nversion. Every other branch is provided **as is**: it compiles and its\nunit tests pass, but no in-game guarantee is made for it.\n\nClient only: install it in `mods/` next to Fabric API. Mod Menu is\noptional. Release notes and the change log live in the repository;\nthe project page is https://piboh.github.io/cleanmcmod/"
